  "$\\mathbf{r}'(t)=(-{@0}\\sin t;\\ {@1}\\cos t;\\ {@2})$, teda $|\\mathbf{r}'(t)|=\\sqrt{{@3}\\sin^2 t+{@4}\\cos^2 t+{@5}}=\\sqrt{{@6}}={@7}$. Dĺžka je $\\int_0^{2\\pi}{@8}\\,dt={@9}\\pi$, koeficient pri $\\pi$ je ${@10}$.": "$\\mathbf{r}'(t)=(-{@0}\\sin t;\\ {@1}\\cos t;\\ {@2})$, por tanto $|\\mathbf{r}'(t)|=\\sqrt{{@3}\\sin^2 t+{@4}\\cos^2 t+{@5}}=\\sqrt{{@6}}={@7}$. La longitud es $\\int_0^{2\\pi}{@8}\\,dt={@9}\\pi$; el coeficiente de $\\pi$ es ${@10}$.",
